Android Ubuntu runtime
----------------------
The Android distribution includes PRoot, its ELF loader, and an Ubuntu 24.04
ARM64 root filesystem obtained from OperitTerminalCore commit
e4442bc6a047b6165bf59103721ad143149c620d:
https://github.com/AAswordman/OperitTerminalCore

OperitTerminalCore is licensed under LGPL-3.0. PRoot is licensed under
GPL-2.0. The Ubuntu root filesystem contains packages under their respective
licenses; package copyright and license files remain available inside
/usr/share/doc in the installed environment. Corresponding upstream source
locations and exact artifact hashes are documented in
docs/android-ubuntu-runtime.md.
